---
number: 147
title: Break Thou the Bread of Life
author: Mary A. Lathbury
composer: William F. Sherwin
sp_category: "12"
topic: The Word of God
---

[verse 1]
Break Thou the bread of life,
Dear Lord, to me,
As Thou didst break the loaves
Beside the sea;
Beyond the sacred page
I seek Thee, Lord;
My spirit pants for Thee,
O living Word!

[verse 2]
Bless Thou the truth revealed
This day to me,
As Thou didst bless the bread
By Galilee;
Then shall all bondage cease,
All fetters fall;
And I shall find in Thee
My all in all!

[verse 3]
Spirit and life are they,
Words Thou dost speak;
I hasten to obey,
But I am weak;
Thou art my only help,
Thou art my life;
Heeding Thy holy word
I win the strife.
